Class
 Foam::turbulentDFMVeerInletFvPatchVectorField

Description
 Digital-filter turbulent inflow (Klein et al. 2003; Xie & Castro 2008)
 with a height-dependent mean wind direction psi(z) (wind veer).

 Mean velocity : U(z) e_x', e_x' = cos(psi) n + sin(psi) t
 Fluctuation : Q (B v), B B^T = R (local frame), Q = [e_x' e_y' e_z']
 Length scales : L_ij given in the local frame (component i, direction j).
 Vertical: L_iz'
 In-plane horizontal t:
 (sin^2 psi/L_ix'^2 + cos^2 psi/L_iy'^2)^(-1/2)
 Along wind: time scale T_i = L_ix'/U (Taylor)
 Flux : rescaled to sum(U cos(psi) |Sf|).
 psi = 0 reproduces turbulentDFMInlet exactly (up to the random stream).

 Input (constant/boundaryData/<patch>/, lists without FoamFile header
 linearly interpolated in height):
 points pointField
 U scalarField mean wind speed magnitude [m/s]
 R symmTensorField local-frame Reynolds stress [m2/s2]
 L tensorField local-frame integral length scales [m]
 psi scalarField wind direction [deg], optional (default 0)
 Each of U R L psi may instead be given as a field entry in the dictionary
 (this is what is written at write times and used for restart).

Usage
 \table
 Property | Description | Req | Default
 filterType | exponential, gaussian, bessel | no | exponential
 filterFactor | kernel half-width / n | no | 2
 gridFactor | sqrt(min |Sf|)/virtual spacing | no | 1
 periodicInY | periodic along in-plane t | no | false
 periodicInZ | periodic along vertical | no | false
 constMeanU | use Uref in time scales | no | false
 Uref | reference speed | no | 10
 verticalAxis | vertical direction | no | (0 0 1)
 correctFlux | rescale to target flux | no | true
 seed | RNG seed (<0: time based) | no | -1
 cleanRestart | ignore stored uFluctTemporal | no | false
 outputFaceIndices | local face indices to log | no | 
 \endtable

